      "Dwy6uiAWkAA_JTC.jpeg",
      "Dwy6-GVWwAE4sil.jpeg",
      "Dwy7Iq3W0AIKLf_.jpeg"
    ],
    "content": "<p>Can you imagine a more magical place than northern #Finland? The snow tundra in\n#lapland is a breathtakingly calm area which can be demanding to conquer but\nrewards with incredible views. This is where\n<a href=\"https://codefreeze.fi/\">Codefreeze</a> takes place every January, at Suomen Latu\nKiilopää. #codefreeze</p>\n"
  },
  {
    "author": {
      "name": "Markus Tacker | @coderbyheart@chaos.social",
      "twitter": "@coderbyheart"
    },
    "date": "2019-07-25T22:43:36.000Z",
    "content": "<p>#codefreeze in one tweet? Here you go:</p>\n<p>Family friendly Vegan Cabins Freeze off your ass with friends Saunas Board Games\nAuroras Someone will explain Monads Pan cakes over open fire Someone will\nexplain Monads, again Reindeer Sledge ride Freeze off your face with more\nfriends</p>\n"
  },
