  {
    "author": { "name": "Amélie Cornélis", "twitter": "@AmelieCornelis" },
    "date": "2020-01-13T18:12:57.000Z",
    "media": [
      "EOLkRrWXUAcTkmk.jpeg",
      "EOLjpgAX4AExOwK.jpeg",
      "EOLjqfNXUAU2wR9.jpeg",
      "EOLjsBIX4AIbv_L.jpeg",
      "EOLjswXXsAMiiU0.jpeg"
    ],
    "content": "<p>A perfect day at #codefreeze : lots of nice views during a ski hike (the light\nhere is amazing), a refactoring session alongside coffee and squeaky cheese,\nthen back and forth between the smoke sauna and the dip. Now chilling amongst\namazing folks before diner 😍</p>\n<p>Now it got even better: I wrote up the couple of sessions I was thinking about.\nAnd... we&#39;re cooking pancake over an open fire!</p>\n<p>And to cap the day, 3 sessions in the same room tonight: more refactoring,\nknitting and lock picking (and there were others elsewhere 🙂). I love variety\n😍</p>\n"
  },
